 - `distillation.distillation_loss.use_policy_gradient=True|False`
 - `distillation.distillation_loss.topk=64`
+
+### vOPD
+
+`run_vopd_fsdp.sh` configures a detached reverse-KL control variate with the existing
+FSDP OPD trainer. `VOPD_MODE=vopd_topk` (default) uses the student's top-k support;
+`VOPD_MODE=vopd_full` requests the full teacher vocabulary. See
+[the vOPD documentation](../../docs/algo/opd.md#vopd-distillation-with-a-control-variate-baseline)
+for supported settings, sparse scoring latency, and full-vocabulary memory costs.
